// Sound set ids (doc/rewrite/systems.md section 16). Rows live in code/game/sound_sets.dm.
// Generated from the literal playsound() call sites; add new ids here, sorted, and a row there.

/// Declares a sound set row inside /proc/build_sound_sets(): SOUND_SET(id, files, volume, vary[, extrarange, falloff])
#define SOUND_SET(id, arguments...) .[id] = new /datum/sound_set(id, ##arguments)

